      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The goal is to maintain the *feeling* of untouchable, inherited prestige, regardless of the features, which means focusing on impeccable grooming, flawless presentation, and an air of supreme detachment. For the East Asian archetype, focus on porcelain perfection and subtle, sharp elegance. For the Black archetype, emphasize deep, luminous skin tones paired with regal composure and striking bone structure. For the Middle Eastern archetype, lean into dramatic, timeless beauty and an aura of ancient, powerful lineage.\n\nHere are the prompts:\n\n1.  **East Asian Archetype:** `Hyper-detailed portrait of the Platonic ideal of East Asian aristocracy, flawless porcelain skin, exquisitely refined features, serene and distant gaze, immaculate, minimalist styling, wearing couture in deep jade and black, dramatic soft studio lighting, cinematic, ultra-photorealistic, 8k, shot on Hasselblad.`\n2.  **Black Archetype:** `Hyper-detailed portrait of the Platonic ideal of Black aristocracy, luminous, deep ebony skin, commanding and regal bone structure, eyes conveying profound, inherited power, hair styled in an immaculate, sculptural fashion, wearing haute couture in rich jewel tones, dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, cinematic, ultra-photorealistic, 8k,",
